From bb9b2a573c78f9f31bc1bf17c1475b6f13f71e82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09_Dev <aloplop090708@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:30:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace unfixable Google Photos backup promo with a
 donation/support banner

Google Play Services rejects this app's signature (SHA-256 policy), so
the native Google Photos backup integration can never work on this ROM.
Repurpose the existing home-page banner and Settings row instead of
leaving dead, misleading UI:
- ic_icon_google.xml (vector G logo) replaced by the ROM's own logo
  (ic_icon_google.jpg, same resource name so existing references pick
  it up with no layout/code changes).
- Banner strings changed to a support/donation message with Ko-fi
  (positive/highlighted button) and Telegram (negative button) links.
- GoogleHandleImpl.positiveClick/negativeClick (case "1", the banner's
  own click path) now open the Ko-fi / Telegram URLs directly instead of
  the old Google Photos jump.
- GoogleBackupSettingsBanner.onClickView replaced with a single Ko-fi
  intent launch, keeping the existing isFastClick() debounce guard.
---
 res/drawable/ic_icon_google.jpg               | Bin 0 -> 144546 bytes
 res/drawable/ic_icon_google.xml               |  11 ---
 res/values-es/strings.xml                     |  32 +++----
 res/values/strings.xml                        |  32 +++----
 .../ui/view/GoogleBackupSettingsBanner.smali  |  88 ++----------------
 .../homewidget/google/GoogleHandleImpl.smali  |  52 ++++-------
 6 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 159 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 res/drawable/ic_icon_google.jpg
 delete mode 100644 res/drawable/ic_icon_google.xml

diff --git a/res/drawable/ic_icon_google.jpg b/res/drawable/ic_icon_google.jpg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..0abeab478ee1ff74cfc9ce34f509eef85175e44f
